=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fb6217b174da7f5ba326c11ddfed930a 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして、\nもし宜しければ僕のキャラクターを描いて頂けないでしょうか？\n\n彼をHxHのクラピカがしてるポーズとkhrの山本武みたいに水しぶきが上がっている用な絵をお願い致します。\n他の構図や表情などはお任せ致します。\n\n以上、ご検討よろしくお願い致します。\n\n参考画像へのリンク:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/p3qBKWJ", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@7pcih/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1184734, "client_id": 300951, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de08cfe441dd4ab55661e36ba2447dbd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de08cfe441dd4ab55661e36ba2447dbd, https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18d2723c6d6ad175fab10f40d3ce452e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15772d9017d4b562e3db28497da0ec2c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5b154fc6852a49888c533581e640fef", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5b154fc6852a49888c533581e640fef, https://si.imgix.net/632d0a73/uploads/origins/32b6c141-b3f2-44ad-8c14-251c50193c9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=t